31. 听到“...the eucalyptus tree is an important tree ...”对应小标题 Importance, 定位到第 1 题; 紧接着“For example，it gives shelter to creatures like birds and bats, 给出答案，根据后半句“...and other species also depend on it for food”原词重现题目后续信息，可确认答案为 shelter;

