38. 根据 low-frequency bushfires 定位, 听到“...that this reduced frequency of bushfires to low levels has led to what is known as dry rainforest;

39. 听到问题 “And what special about this type of rainforest?”与题目对应，接着 听到“well, unlike tropical rainforest, which is a rich ecosystem, this type of ecosystem is usually a simple one.”直接给出答案，此题注意不要被 unlike后信息干扰，听时抓主要结构；

